# Installed by `npm ci` / `npm install` — ~200 MB of third-party source that a
# lockfile already describes. Never belongs in a commit. No trailing slash on
# purpose: a secondary worktree may hold a SYMLINK here instead of the tree, and
# `node_modules/` matches directories only, which leaves the link untracked and
# one `git add -A` away from being committed.
node_modules
# `vite build` writes straight into ../src/webui (see vite.config.ts), so a
# stray `dist/` here would only ever be the wreckage of a changed config.
dist/
# Local overrides for `npm run dev` (proxy target, port).
*.local
